    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0465","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ếlodie Vasquez talks about what the gallery cleaner threw away. A curator joined for ten minutes and left convinced that the chair was part of the exhibition.</Description>
